      "band_085_095": [
        {
          "start": 589.56,
          "end": 594.6,
          "text": "It's almost like you get to do a certain kind of like civic chiropractic healing. Yeah. Yeah",
          "dur": 5.04,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.95
        },
        {
          "start": 827.66,
          "end": 833.14,
          "text": "Crumbles, it's like there are like like a set of like Wario doctors out there namely MAGA",
          "dur": 5.48,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.95
        },
        {
          "start": 542.4,
          "end": 547.26,
          "text": "people come they bring their questions and they ask them in front of their neighbors and",
          "dur": 4.86,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9498
        },
        {
          "start": 641.26,
          "end": 646.26,
          "text": "It's three things. The first one is anything having to do with care health care child care senior care",
          "dur": 5.0,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9497
        },
        {
          "start": 1734.7,
          "end": 1741.1,
          "text": "The poverty that we have in America that afflicts predominantly black folk in this country and rural folk in this country is",
          "dur": 6.4,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9497
        },
        {
          "start": 1782.6,
          "end": 1788.86,
          "text": "Then anybody out there to make their first hundred thousand, right? This is what happens first ten thousand first five thousand",
          "dur": 6.26,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9497
        },
        {
          "start": 538.94,
          "end": 541.7,
          "text": "because you know town halls are as old as democracy and",
          "dur": 2.76,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9496
        },
        {
          "start": 679.16,
          "end": 685.18,
          "text": "then the third one where this often comes up is just this dread about AI and it shows up in they're gonna put",
          "dur": 6.02,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9496
        },
        {
          "start": 665.84,
          "end": 671.26,
          "text": "They're getting older and they're needing care and I can't offer it and I'm I'm losing hours at work",
          "dur": 5.42,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9492
        },
        {
          "start": 1151.1,
          "end": 1154.42,
          "text": "Made sure that after Flint kids weren't drinking lead in their schools",
          "dur": 3.32,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9492
        },
        {
          "start": 1154.86,
          "end": 1159.72,
          "text": "That's the kind of work that my career has been about. I wrote the book on Medicare for all so in some respects",
          "dur": 4.86,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9492
        },
        {
          "start": 792.72,
          "end": 800.42,
          "text": "Urgent care needed exactly and then the policy prescription though is like how do you you know, how do you treat appendicitis?",
          "dur": 7.7,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9491
        },
        {
          "start": 1287.94,
          "end": 1290.8,
          "text": "I want to understand exactly what led into the war in Iran.",
          "dur": 2.86,
          "eid": "abdul_morningjoe_20261105",
          "sim": 0.9484
        },
        {
          "start": 367.34,
          "end": 370.22,
          "text": "I kept talking about the same things in the same ways, going everywhere,",
          "dur": 2.88,
          "eid": "abdul_morningjoe_20261105",
          "sim": 0.9482
        },
        {
          "start": 455.4,
          "end": 459.3,
          "text": "And I think people have always seen Donald Trump as this big monster that's unbeatable.",
          "dur": 3.9,
          "eid": "abdul_morningjoe_20261105",
          "sim": 0.948
        },
        {
          "start": 1821.38,
          "end": 1824.04,
          "text": "And what a joy to be able to serve others,",
          "dur": 2.66,
          "eid": "abdul_morningjoe_20261105",
          "sim": 0.948
        },
        {
          "start": 887.92,
          "end": 892.16,
          "text": "But the thing is like I just say the same thing because I'm not I don't take money from corporations",
          "dur": 4.24,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9478
        },
        {
          "start": 405.32,
          "end": 409.34,
          "text": "But the thing about democracy is like we focus on the competition of the thing, but it's not a competition",
          "dur": 4.02,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9474
        },
        {
          "start": 923.08,
          "end": 928.88,
          "text": "You know god-willing people support me and if they don't that's okay, but I'd rather not be in the United States Senate out here",
          "dur": 5.8,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9473
        },
        {
          "start": 1890.42,
          "end": 1893.84,
          "text": "And in fact, I got to speak to the former president",
          "dur": 3.42,
          "eid": "abdul_morningjoe_20261105",
          "sim": 0.947
        },
        {
          "start": 1661.14,
          "end": 1664.0,
          "text": "when it's the most expensive going to the emergency room.",
          "dur": 2.86,
          "eid": "abdul_morningjoe_20261105",
          "sim": 0.9469
        },
        {
          "start": 1655.06,
          "end": 1659.08,
          "text": "Everybody thinks you actually have some power only to be hamstrung to do the thing with power",
          "dur": 4.02,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9466
        },
        {
          "start": 824.26,
          "end": 827.22,
          "text": "And as much as people like J.D. Vance",
          "dur": 2.96,
          "eid": "abdul_morningjoe_20261105",
          "sim": 0.9465
        },
        {
          "start": 305.78,
          "end": 309.6,
          "text": "what they are part of and I'll be honest with you my",
          "dur": 3.82,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9464
        },
        {
          "start": 811.86,
          "end": 817.52,
          "text": "Here is the solution set based on an understanding of public policy that we think can address it now",
          "dur": 5.66,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9464
        },
        {
          "start": 1817.46,
          "end": 1821.24,
          "text": "When we should be spending on schools and health care for our own kids, it doesn't make any sense",
          "dur": 3.78,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9464
        },
        {
          "start": 830.24,
          "end": 833.54,
          "text": "And in J.D.'s case, it's kind of confusing because it's confusing.",
          "dur": 3.3,
          "eid": "abdul_morningjoe_20261105",
          "sim": 0.9462
        },
        {
          "start": 1102.14,
          "end": 1104.76,
          "text": "we have to differentiate between our foreign policy.",
          "dur": 2.62,
          "eid": "abdul_morningjoe_20261105",
          "sim": 0.946
        },
        {
          "start": 310.16,
          "end": 315.86,
          "text": "My family immigrated from a place where there is no democracy there's no chance to run for office. Did you come came from Egypt?",
          "dur": 5.7,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.946
        },
        {
          "start": 373.52,
          "end": 377.36,
          "text": "For the ability to do it because I don't take it for granted it action and of history",
          "dur": 3.84,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9458
        },
        {
          "start": 1571.86,
          "end": 1576.02,
          "text": "The next one that one taller and better-looking that one is nicer than you that one",
          "dur": 4.16,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9458
        },
        {
          "start": 860.58,
          "end": 865.16,
          "text": "So you hear it and then you sort of map it to the policy and then from there you're talking about the policy",
          "dur": 4.58,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9456
        },
        {
          "start": 223.38,
          "end": 226.22,
          "text": "So they talk amongst each other and they get louder and louder and louder.",
          "dur": 2.84,
          "eid": "abdul_morningjoe_20261105",
          "sim": 0.9455
        },
        {
          "start": 409.34,
          "end": 412.7,
          "text": "It really is about trying to reach to people and talk about",
          "dur": 3.36,
          "eid": "abdul_jonstewart_20261021",
          "sim": 0.9452
        },
        {
